WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:05.900
A Notice from the Yamayuri Council
When watching
"Maria Watches Over Us ~Printemps~,"
please have the room brightly lit and
sit well away from the television set.

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:11.900
You don't seem very cheerful.

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:14.310
Spring vacation starts tomorrow,

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:17.400
so when I think of how I won't see
my Onee-sama for a while again...

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:20.310
I'm sorry, Shimako-san.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:22.370
Why are you apologizing to me?

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.650
Because Sei-sama has graduated, and...

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.040
That's true.

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:33.950
This is the place where I met her.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.500
I had entered the high school division,

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.440
and the cherry blossoms
were rejoicing on my behalf.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.270
Even though I may not have been
a person worthy of this place,

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:49.970
the cherry blossoms alone accepted me.

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:05.280
Caught in her clear gaze,
I found I was unable to move.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.420
Who are you?

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:14.070
Pardon me!

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:23.300
At that time, I knew nothing about her.

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:27.540
Not even that she was in a
position to be called a Lady Rose.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:39.450
Maria Watches Over Us
Printemps

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:48.570
In the morning mist,
Asamoya no naka

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:55.470
the white path goes on.
tsuzuku shiroi michi

00:01:56.240 --> 00:02:02.950
The birds sing.
Tori no saezuri

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:10.610
We exchange greetings.
Aisatsu kawashinagara

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:18.100
At times, the clouds hang low,
Toki ni kumo ga tarekomete

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:25.570
and the sun may grow dim.
hizashi kagerou tomo

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:33.670
But I will walk with my chin up,
Sesuji nobashite aruku

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:41.190
for I know,
watashi wa shitteru kara

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:48.120
that above those heavy clouds...
omoi kumo no ue wa

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:56.190
...is the blue sky.
aoi sora

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:02.940
Brought Together by Just One Hand

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:04.710
In May,

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:09.040
the Yamayuri Council held a welcome
ceremony for the new students.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:13.750
There was the person I saw
among the cherry blossoms.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:15.950
Shimako-san.

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:21.220
May Maria-sama watch over you.

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:35.430
When Shimazu Yoshino-san of the
Chrysanthemum Class came to see me,

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:38.170
it was about a week after that.

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:41.120
Where is it that you're taking me?

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.280
To the Rose Mansion.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:42.910
The Rose?

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.620
I became Hasekura Rei-sama's little sister...

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.090
...on the day of the entrance ceremony,

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:50.220
so I'm helping out my dear sisters.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.660
There is someone who would like to see you.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:55.220
Is that the Rosa Gigantea?

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.320
No, the Rosa Chinensis and company.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.400
Why does the Rosa Chinensis want to see me?

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.840
I don't know. Please, just come with me.

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:05.310
Then I will now excuse myself.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:07.870
I apologize for asking you to come here.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:08.940
Not at all.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:11.140
We wanted to talk to you for a bit.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.180
What might this be about?

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.280
Do you have a big sister?

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.110
I-I do not, but...

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:17.980
I'm relieved to hear that.

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:19.910
Then on to the main issue.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.950
Would you be willing to help us
out here at the Yamayuri Council?

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.090
Pardon?

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:27.200
We serve as the student body council...

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.860
...and our little sisters serve as our assistants.

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:33.000
But the Rosa Gigantea alone
has no little sister, so...

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:35.500
She has no little sister...

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:39.070
Yes. But the circumstances
of that are irrelevant here.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:42.240
Practically speaking, the Yamayuri
Council is currently understaffed.

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:44.640
But, why me?

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:47.920
Congratulations! You were chosen from
among all the first-year students...

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.910
...through a fair and unbiased lottery.

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:51.250
Is that true?

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.410
Of course not.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:56.320
What are you doing?!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.090
Wasn't today's meeting canceled?!

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:02.260
And why is she here?!

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:04.230
We thought we would have Todo Shimako-san...

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:06.930
...help us out here at the Yamayuri Council.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.190
What?!

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:11.160
Would you please stop doing
meddlesome things like that?!

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:14.170
This really has nothing to do with you.

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:16.330
Of course it does!

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:19.210
Considering the first-year student
who was summoned here...

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:22.740
...is the person whose name
I accidentally let slip the other day...

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.210
Accidentally, huh?

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:26.610
Get out!

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:29.120
Leave this room this instant!

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:30.190
But...

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:31.690
Get out!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.690
Please...

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.180
...get out!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.530
Please do as she asks.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:53.110
Is it all right to let them be?

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:55.120
Those two? It's fine, it's fine.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.380
Shimako-san, was it?

00:05:57.720 --> 00:05:59.120
That must have been quite a scare for you.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.980
Yes. Oh, no...

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:03.620
I heard this from Yoshino-chan, but...

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:06.990
You're involved in a committee?

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:07.950
Yes.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.330
What committee?

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.390
The School Environment
Maintenance Committee.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.900
That seems so fitting somehow.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.000
Do you also want to live in a paradise
where there are no people?

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:18.140
What?

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:21.840
There's someone like that
among my friends, you see.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.240
Shimako-san, are you...

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:29.440
...interested in helping with the
work of the student council?

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:30.720
Yes...

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.190
Then, come to the Rose Mansion again.

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:38.190
I want you to take a good look at us
and draw your own conclusions.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:43.030
If I come to the Rose Mansion while
my status is still uncertain,

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:45.260
won't I be an eyesore for Rosa Gigantea?

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:50.570
Before you worry about others,
you ought to first think about yourself.

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.900
About myself?

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:57.170
Besides, Rosa Gigantea is in the same position.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:58.410
Pardon?

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:01.170
That is to say, uncertain.

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:22.300
No matter how coldly she treated me,

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:27.230
erasing my existence from Lillian
for Rosa Gigantea's sake...

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:28.830
...was not a choice for me.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:32.380
For my own sake, I made up my mind.

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:35.840
Who is it?

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:38.550
Good day.

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.220
Come to see Rosa Chinensis?

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.480
No, any one of the Lady Roses will do.

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.320
She'll probably be here shortly.

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:47.820
Come inside and wait.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.170
Are you coming...

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:56.200
...to help out?

00:07:57.070 --> 00:08:00.370
If you would rather I didn't,
I will not insist on coming.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:03.040
What I think has nothing to do with this.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:06.540
Rosa Foetida told me the same thing.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:11.050
So, if I say it's okay, you'll start
working at the Rose Mansion?

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.040
Yes.

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:16.810
I'll have you know, that won't mean
you'll become my little sister.

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:18.880
I know that.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:22.860
If this offer was hinged on
becoming your little sister,

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.090
I would not accept it.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.470
How terribly clear cut of you.

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:27.690
Oh, pardon me.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:28.770
Then, what?

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:32.410
Todo Shimako-san is willing
to serve the Yamayuri Council...

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:34.370
...in the capacity of a mere helper?

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:35.100
Why?

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:40.300
If there is a place that has
need of even someone like me...

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:44.610
Fine. Please help with the Yamayuri Council.

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:47.420
To begin with, wash those cups.

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:48.350
Yes, ma'am.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:53.890
Starting that day, I became an interim
resident of the Rose Mansion.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.100
By the time summer rolled around,

00:08:57.100 --> 00:08:59.900
I had grown to enjoy the time
I spent at the Rose Mansion.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:02.330
We're doing the major clean-up
work before summer break, but...

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:06.110
Surrounded by the people known
as the Rose Families,

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:09.410
at times, I would forget my own status...

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:11.880
...and almost feel like I was
a part of that circle of people.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:14.840
It was a very mellow atmosphere.

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:17.980
Shimako and Yoshino-chan,
that will be for you to handle.

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:19.180
Yes, ma'am.
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:22.110
It felt very pleasant to be called just "Shimako."

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.820
Rosa Gigantea began calling me
that and following her example,

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:30.020
everyone, except for Yoshino-san,
just calls me "Shimako" now.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.430
My impression of Rosa Gigantea
differed with every occasion.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:38.230
By turns mysterious, scary, or kind...

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:43.100
Even so, it was a relief
just to have her presence there.

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:45.210
I wasn't alone.

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:48.480
That was the kind of reassurance
her existence offered me.

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:57.950
That's right...

00:09:58.360 --> 00:09:59.590
It's not a big deal.

00:10:10.070 --> 00:10:12.770
Rosa Gigantea... huh?

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:15.570
Listen to me.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.450
You tend to get drawn into things easily,

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.150
so if you find something that you value,

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:21.580
make yourself take a step back from it.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:24.650
All I ever did was depend on you...

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:26.710
...and I haven't been able
to do anything in return...

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:30.550
If you want to return the favor,
pay it forward to someone else...

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:33.820
Yes, perhaps to your future little sister.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:42.530
Who are you?

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:44.130
Pardon me!

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:48.800
She startled me...

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:50.770
For a moment, I thought it was Shiori.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.940
A first-year student, huh?

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:57.180
I soon found out the name of
that first-year student.

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:01.220
Todo Shimako.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.520
That was her name.

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:06.590
May Maria-sama watch over you.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:09.490
Is that true?

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:10.990
Of course not.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:13.530
What are you doing?!

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.740
Why is she here?!

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:20.510
I knew she wasn't to blame,

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:22.770
but I could not control my rage.

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:29.810
Is that girl such a significant person to you?

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.010
I don't know!

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:34.210
I had never even given it any thought.

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:37.630
But Yoko had the ability to
perceive what was in my heart,

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:39.650
even more accurately than I could.

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.180
She always could.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:45.730
Even if I do have special
feelings for Todo Shimako,

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:50.700
that's no reason for you to drag
her into the Yamayuri Council!

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:51.670
But you see...

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:52.900
No buts!

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:58.910
Don't do things like this without consulting me!

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:04.350
Sei.

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:07.950
Even now, I have some regrets.

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:09.750
About Shiori-san.

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:11.930
Even if you called me meddlesome,

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:15.000
I should have forced you and
Shiori-san to become soeurs.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.770
That way, you may have been able
to make some good memories,

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:20.390
at least for the two years that
you were in high school.

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:23.000
So you're telling me to
play soeurs with that girl,

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:24.900
because I didn't get to do it with Shiori?

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:28.240
I'm not thinking of her as
a replacement for Shiori-san.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:31.610
It's just that I want you to be more
involved with other people.

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:35.840
I'm plenty involved with you and
Eriko and Sachiko and the others!

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:39.340
When you blurted out the name Todo Shimako,

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:42.120
you had the same expression on your face...

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.420
...as when you first mentioned Kubo Shiori.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:46.660
And having actually seen her,
I realized something.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.090
Shimako-san is similar.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:49.290
She is not!

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:51.690
She's completely different from Shiori!

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.130
She's similar to you.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.140
To me?

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.530
I'll refrain from saying exactly how.

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:00.860
Because if I do, you'll slap me for real this time.

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:06.310
How we're similar has to do
with my weakness, doesn't it?

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:11.320
Yes. But I love even the weakness in you.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:16.820
I really hate the strength in you.

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:18.650
I know.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:20.820
I don't like it, either.

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.100
You dummy.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:33.060
She's similar to you.

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:39.040
That day, it was quiet at the Rose Mansion.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:42.810
Who is it?

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:46.050
Good day.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:50.750
It was only then that I realized
Yoko had set me up.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:54.790
Undaunted by my sardonic attitude
towards her, Shimako had this to say.

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:59.860
If there is a place that has need
of even someone like me...

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.100
I like your face, Sei.

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:08.140
So come stay by my side.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:11.570
At that time, I responded,

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.010
"If the face of someone like me will do."

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:20.510
Fine. Please help with the Yamayuri Council.

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:21.920
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.550
We aren't just similar.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.360
Shimako is me.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.280
Shimako is doing great work.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.080
Yeah.

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:45.080
There was a time when I thought to
have her become your little sister,

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:48.010
but I've become loathe to let her go
for entirely different reasons now.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:49.780
What do you mean?

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:53.010
Don't you think she should
become a Lady Rose someday?

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:56.760
Losing her would be a detriment
for the Yamayuri Council.

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:01.560
Who cares about what
happens after we graduate?

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.690
That is how you always run away from things.

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:08.030
I have no intention of making
her my little sister, all right?

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:09.630
It can be arranged in many ways.

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:12.630
"Many," huh?

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:19.240
Shiori...

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.310
To me, you were...

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:24.840
...an angel.

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:28.250
But Shimako is human.

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:31.460
I gaze upon her from a place slightly apart.

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:32.950
That's all I want.

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:34.320
That feels comfortable.

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:10.290
You like cats?

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:12.530
Yeah, I do.

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:15.300
What do you plan to do with this cat?

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:16.830
Nothing in particular.

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:19.370
But you are feeding him.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:20.300
Is that wrong?

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:23.310
If he is fed on a regular basis,

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.110
he will not be able to survive in the wild.

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:26.910
That's true.

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:28.950
What will he do during summer break?

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:30.550
Or the cold winter break?

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.280
Or what about after you've graduated?

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:36.850
Isn't it actually more cruel to help him
out of a fleeting sense of sympathy?

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:39.050
Your words hurt.

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:41.660
It may be as you say, Shimako,

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:44.000
but this little guy is still weak, so...

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.400
His injuries from the crow attack
have finally just healed, so...

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:50.460
Let me at least give him a snack once in a while.

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:54.230
But this cat will surely remember...

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:57.280
...the warmth of the Rosa Gigantea's kindness...

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.980
My Onee-sama, who's graduated,

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:03.880
devoted all the love she
had to me when I was hurt.

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:07.550
Thanks to that, even though my
Onee-sama isn't at the Academy anymore,

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:09.350
I've managed to survive somehow.

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.990
I guess hellos and good-byes come in pairs.

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:14.800
The good-bye will come someday,

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:17.400
but to avoid becoming involved
because you fear that...

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:18.760
That'd be too sad, wouldn't it?

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:21.470
Perhaps I was not saying that to Shimako,

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.990
but rather, trying to convince myself of it.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:27.770
Shimako,

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.310
when you finish up here, would you
wait for me at the Rose Mansion?

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:31.580
I'd like to speak with you.

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:32.370
Certainly.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.740
Quit slacking off and help out.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.110
What's with the creepy smile?

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:40.110
Say what you will.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:42.020
I'm in a good mood today.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:43.760
The sports fest went well...

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:46.230
...and it looks like the other
problem will be solved, too.

00:17:47.490 --> 00:17:49.190
The other problem?

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:54.620
Sachiko, are you serious about
making Shimako your little sister?

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:56.440
Yes, these past couple months,

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:59.100
I have watched Todo Shimako in my own way.

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:04.770
And I have determined the Yamayuri
Council has a need for her talent.

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:06.810
You're going to make her your little sister,

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.780
because the Yamayuri Council needs her?

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:10.180
Yoko put you up to this, didn't she?

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:11.020
No.

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:14.750
I believe I do not need anyone's
permission to choose a little sister.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:16.620
That's definitely true,

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:19.680
but what do you even know about Shimako?

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:22.700
The one thing I do know for certain...

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:26.690
...is that it's not good for her to
remain in her current situation.

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:28.700
Either release her,

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:32.140
or officially bring her into the Rose
Mansion as someone's little sister.

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:33.870
We must do one or the other for her.

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:36.700
All right.

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:39.210
So you understand?

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:41.780
I understand, but I can't let you have Shimako.

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:42.510
What?

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:45.310
I'll make Shimako my little sister.

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.950
You are the latecomer and yet,
you intend to snatch her away?

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:53.090
I'm the one who first found Shimako.

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:56.960
Besides, she hasn't accepted
your rosary yet, right?

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:59.060
Did you hear that from Shimako?

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:01.260
No, I'm just sure that she wouldn't have.

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:02.160
Why?

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:06.100
Because I'm better for Shimako, of course.

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:07.170
Later.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.080
Um, Rosa Gigantea,

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:17.950
class is about to start!

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:19.380
Just come with me!

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:24.310
There's a time limit to this,

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:26.720
but become my little sister.

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:32.470
In general, one could hardly say
that I'm a desirable big sister,

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:34.630
but I think I'll probably be perfect for you.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:38.030
I won't impose any limits on you.
You can just do as you please.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:40.530
Um, I...

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:45.370
Will the Rosa Gigantea accept all that I am?

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:47.210
Even after she finds out about everything,

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:49.550
will she still want to make me her little sister?

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:51.550
You don't want to?

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.350
I'm not saying that!

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:54.250
But...

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:55.410
No buts.

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:57.990
What I want to hear is yes or no. That's all.

00:19:58.790 --> 00:19:59.880
I...

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:03.930
We ended up saying hello.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:05.830
Like two people on a long journey,

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:08.820
who just happened to choose the
shade of the same tree to rest in.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:12.540
Even if we do not speak to
one another about ourselves,

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:13.800
we can be together.

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:17.580
While knowing that we will
eventually go our separate ways,

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:21.210
each allows the other to enjoy a brief
moment of respite for her soul.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:24.180
Neither there to give something,

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:26.620
nor there to demand something,

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.050
the other person need merely exist.

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:32.820
And I had found such a person.

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:35.890
Please make me your little sister.

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:38.120
I look forward to our time together.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:40.600
Oh, yeah.

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.400
We need a rosary to do this, don't we?

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:46.310
This will be more convenient.

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:49.440
Easy to remove at any time.

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:53.440
Um...

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:56.510
Why don't we get back class?

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:59.440
Right now, we're only about fifteen minutes late.

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.880
Shimako, you're really too serious.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:05.890
And you, Onee-sama, are lacking in seriousness.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:08.420
Can't be helped. Then, shall we go?

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:10.550
Shimako, sprint!

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:16.000
Oh, how... how comfortable that felt.

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:18.370
There, where we were brought
together by just one hand,

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:19.770
was the place where I belonged.

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:24.040
In half a year, the day to say
good-bye would come inexorably.

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:27.680
But until then, I would never...

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.110
...let go of her hand.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:37.550
Rosa Gigantea.

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:41.360
Rosa Gigantea? Where?

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:41.600
What are you doing, Yumi-san?
Rosa Gigantea? Where?

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:42.990
What are you doing, Yumi-san?

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:45.060
I was addressing Shimako-san.

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:49.630
Oh, right! You're the Rosa
Gigantea now, aren't you?

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.530
Please address me by name, as you always have.

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:01.720
Once April comes,
the first-year students will come in.

00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:04.120
But it still hasn't sunk in at all...

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:05.950
...that we're going to be second-year students.

00:22:06.350 --> 00:22:08.480
Well, that's more like you anyway, Yumi-san.

00:22:10.590 --> 00:22:12.790
The season of the cherry
blossoms is coming again.

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:15.550
The hellos and good-byes will be repeated.

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:19.170
Spring comes again this year.

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:28.970
A landowner from southern Russia,
Madame Ranevskaya...

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:31.170
...lives in Paris with her lover
after becoming a widow,

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:33.410
but she is betrayed by her lover,
and at her wits' end financially,

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:36.110
she returns to her old estate,
but that estate is also mortgaged...

00:23:36.110 --> 00:23:37.380
...and she finds herself on
the verge of bankruptcy.

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:38.910
It is a tale of the fall of the old
landowners and the aristocracy,

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:41.210
and the contrasting rise of the new bourgeoisie.

00:23:41.210 --> 00:23:42.980
You are talking about The Cherry
Orchard, are you not, Yoshino-san?

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:45.190
Please do not brazenly state the
preview for a different work.

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:47.450
No, the cry in my heart echoes that of Chekhov.

00:23:47.450 --> 00:23:49.390
"Good-bye, old life! Welcome, new life!"

00:23:49.390 --> 00:23:49.820
Next time on "Maria Watches Over Us,"

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:50.590
Next time on "Maria Watches Over Us,"
Next Time "Cherry Blossoms"

00:23:50.590 --> 00:23:51.690
"Cherry Blossoms".
Next Time "Cherry Blossoms"

00:23:51.690 --> 00:23:51.760
Next Time "Cherry Blossoms"

00:23:51.760 --> 00:23:54.330
It appears something is going
to happen to Shimako-san.
Next Time "Cherry Blossoms"

00:23:54.330 --> 00:23:55.620
Next Time "Cherry Blossoms"
